fixture cam_look_down
doc BUILD.md s5 feel rules "look-down on crouch hold"; s12 default pad "look-down (hold stick down)"
room test/camera
spawn 1890 1600
frames 200
input
  # A short crouch does not look down; a held one does, and letting go looks back up.
  10..19 D
  40..139 D
end
expect
  at 10 crouch=1
  at 20 crouch=0
  during 40..139 crouch=1
  at 140 crouch=0
end
